                                                "sense_id": "0ab34f56-2d90-3410-ae5a-a2238acd2955",
                                                "text": "December 4 2010, Evan Thomas, \"Why It’s Time to Worry\", in Newsweekk\nAmerica's social harmony has depended at least to some degree on economic growth. It is easier to get along when everyone, more or less, is getting ahead."
                                            }
